# Production (GKE) build config — baked into the bundle by `vite build`.
# The cockpit reaches in-cluster backends through nginx.conf's /svc/* + /api proxies.
#
# Only overrides that DIFFER from the code defaults live here. hellgraph/algo/ie/sherlock
# already default to /svc/*, and /api → dashboard-bff is the built-in default — so they
# need no entry. VITE_STUDIO_API has no default (unset → Studio surfaces fall back to
# stubs), so it must be set here to light up Notebooks / Compute Plane / Governance /
# Commons / Experiments against the deployed lattice-studio service.
VITE_STUDIO_API=/svc/studio

# NOTE: VITE_AGENT_MACHINE is intentionally NOT set yet — the agent-machine (Noetica)
# backend isn't deployed in-cluster, so its surfaces stay on their graceful-stub path
# until that lands (Tier 2b). Setting it before the backend exists would only 502.
